  "goodToKnow": "Rudern means to row: über den See rudern, ein Ruderboot (rowing boat). Rowing is a popular club sport in Germany, and the Deutschland-Achter (men's eight) is a famous Olympic crew. When rowing somewhere, the perfect takes sein: Wir sind ans Ufer gerudert. Figuratively, zurückrudern means to backpedal on a statement, a favourite word in political reporting. Das Ruder is the oar or the rudder: am Ruder sein means to be at the helm."
